---@field maxRating? number Optional. Restricts results to places whose average user rating is strictly less than or equal to max_rating. Values must be between 1.0 and 5.0.
---@field minRating? number Optional. Restricts results to places whose average user rating is greater than or equal to min_rating. Values must be between 1.0 and 5.0.

